(: Rebuking, vowing and dedicating merit (

    You have very powerful tools for managing your own context. You can say "I hereby rebuke" and if you clearly state what\who you are rebuking, the egregore name, symbolic demon, samsaric force, asura, negative entity, mara, and what they generated specifically that you are getting neutral observdr distance from. Another one is "I vow". Instead of purifying unwholesome karma (through rebuking), vowing is cultivating wholesome karma. you can assume anything you vow you will do in precision, so only maks vows when you feel you are truly ready. If you wish to cultivate with less speed, you can say " I commit to"..Vowing also is resolution practice..You can also spontaneously dedicate any and all merit to the full liberation of sentient beings.

) End Rebuking, vowing and dedicating merit :) With gratitude for this reading
